Hello,

Attached (and inlined) patch fixes ipt_ROUTE compliation under 2.6.14.
There are two version of this patch - one that fixes patchlets/ROUTE/linux
and second that adds patchlets/ROUTE/linux-2.6.14.


diff -Nur patch-o-matic-ng-20051019-orig/patchlets/ROUTE/linux-2.6.11/net/i=
pv4/netfilter/ipt_ROUTE.c patch-o-matic-ng-20051019/patchlets/ROUTE/linux-2=
=2E6.11/net/ipv4/netfilter/ipt_ROUTE.c
--- patch-o-matic-ng-20051019-orig/patchlets/ROUTE/linux-2.6.11/net/ipv4/ne=
tfilter/ipt_ROUTE.c=092005-04-01 08:50:41.000000000 +0200
+++ patch-o-matic-ng-20051019/patchlets/ROUTE/linux-2.6.11/net/ipv4/netfilt=
er/ipt_ROUTE.c=092005-10-20 17:59:22.000000000 +0200
@@ -377,7 +377,6 @@
  =09=09skb->nfct =3D &route_tee_track.ct_general;
  =09=09skb->nfctinfo =3D IP_CT_NEW;
  =09=09nf_conntrack_get(skb->nfct);
-=09=09skb->nfcache =3D 0;
  #ifdef CONFIG_NETFILTER_DEBUG
  =09=09skb->nf_debug =3D 0;
  #endif


Best regards,

 =09=09=09=09Krzysztof Ol=EAdzki
